  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health guarantee CRDB - Health guarantee</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">H&#xe4;lsogaranti CRDB</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As the decision on contribution was prepared in templates (before the introduction of Trac), the objectives of the intervention are not clearly stated in the decision and appraisal document.
Since this is a guarantee, the expected results in USAID&apos;s initial programme document mainly focus on financial outcomes and the banks performance:
OUTPUTS: With the guarantee, it is expected that Centenary bank will increase its level of lending to the health sector, both in terms of numbers of loans and amounts, by engaging loan officers to actively seek borrowers in this sector with the support of the guarantee.&#xa0;
OUTCOMES: After the guarantee concludes, Centenary bank would have significantly increased its lending portfolio to private sector health care enterprises.&#xa0;
IMPACTS: USAID anticipates that as Centenary bank takes a visible leading role in the Ugandan financial services sector on how to sustainably and profitably extend credit to the private health sector, the economic viability and creditworthiness of this sector will become self-evident to the commercial financial institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health guarantee in cooperation to increase accesst to financing for  the private sector health facilities.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">H&#xe4;lsogaranti i samarbete med USAID f&#xf6;r att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra satsningar inom privata sektorn f&#xf6;r h&#xe4;lsa</narrative>
  </description>
